  "question": {
    "text": "As shown in figure, the tension in the horizontal cord is <math><mn>30</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>N</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The weight <math><mi>w</mi></math> and tension in the string <math><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></math> in newton are<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0138_39410a578be4.png\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>30</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>60</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>60</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>30</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "None of the above",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Horizontal and vertical components of tension are shown in the figure.<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0138_7879e12ddeb9.png\" /><br /><br />From the figure, <math><mi>T</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mrow></math> .....(i)<br /><br /><math><mi>T</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></mrow></math> .....(ii)<br /><br />By solving Equations (i) and (ii), we get<br /><br /><math><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&nbsp;N</mi></math><br /><br />and <math><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>N</mn></math>"
  }
}